      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "White boys mockin' this shit and y'all mad at me? Y'all can suck my dick (Suck my dick)",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Pull up old tweets, pull up old t-shirts, all that, I'll moonwalk over that bitch (Hee-hee)",
          "rhyme": "itS",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "See, T changed like the 'fit got dirty",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I was young man, then a nigga hit thirty",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I was one mil', then a nigga hit thirty",
