        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "I like the farm with the lake, I like some truth in my space",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Y'all niggas friendly and fake",
          "rhyme": "Ejk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "\"That's big bro,\" how, when y'all met yesterday?",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "This feel Planet of the Apes",
          "rhyme": "ap",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "Why am I filled with this hate? Got freedom in every way",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
